{"tag": "zh_000000", "lang": "zh", "split": "split_demo", "original_idx": 0, "original_audio": "/inspire/hdd/project/embodied-multimodality/public/kxhuang/instructtts_data/instruction_12khrs_new_asr_partial_wavs/chinese_drama/zh_short/1/Speechpretrain_Speech-chinese_drama_flac-segment-00-e34ba2881bfca8905c6d51c4c73bf15c-002.flac", "ref_text": "我也搞不清楚，找个机会去问问他。", "moss_output": "/inspire/qb-ilm2/project/embodied-multimodality/public/xyzhang/projects/vcdata_construction/outputs/instruction_0.1_enzh/zh/split_demo/ref_audio/000000_ref.wav", "original_text": "纤维瘤是不能熬夜的，早点睡觉，听到了吗？"}
