{"tag": "zh_000002", "lang": "zh", "split": "split_demo", "original_idx": 2, "original_audio": "/inspire/hdd/project/embodied-multimodality/public/kxhuang/instructtts_data/instruction_12khrs_new_asr_partial_wavs/chinese_drama/zh_short/1/Speechpretrain_Speech-chinese_drama_flac-segment-00-506ce023b7d1ea2c90ccc84bc0136790-002.flac", "ref_text": "都动筷子呀，这一会儿菜凉了，辜负姜老板的一番好意嘛啊。", "moss_output": "/inspire/qb-ilm2/project/embodied-multimodality/public/xyzhang/projects/vcdata_construction/outputs/instruction_0.1_enzh/zh/split_demo/ref_audio/000002_ref.wav", "original_text": "宫中的磨毛凤我燕神，你并未是真。"}
{"tag": "zh_000003", "lang": "zh", "split": "split_demo", "original_idx": 3, "original_audio": "/inspire/hdd/project/embodied-multimodality/public/kxhuang/instructtts_data/instruction_12khrs_new_asr_partial_wavs/chinese_drama/zh_short/1/Speechpretrain_Speech-chinese_drama_flac-segment-00-8ec77ca93293820efa97501358a0fbfc-028.flac", "ref_text": "行，那你给我修吧，你在这待着，我过去看一下。", "moss_output": "/inspire/qb-ilm2/project/embodied-multimodality/public/xyzhang/projects/vcdata_construction/outputs/instruction_0.1_enzh/zh/split_demo/ref_audio/000003_ref.wav", "original_text": "再问问明创老师，小白呢？"}
{"tag": "zh_000004", "lang": "zh", "split": "split_demo", "original_idx": 4, "original_audio": "/inspire/hdd/project/embodied-multimodality/public/kxhuang/instructtts_data/instruction_12khrs_new_asr_partial_wavs/chinese_drama/zh_short/1/Speechpretrain_Speech-chinese_drama_flac-segment-00-d925a686fe70a05bc2de98652663d4f7-002.flac", "ref_text": "小林哥，我早就想去好汉滨了，你带我去吧。", "moss_output": "/inspire/qb-ilm2/project/embodied-multimodality/public/xyzhang/projects/vcdata_construction/outputs/instruction_0.1_enzh/zh/split_demo/ref_audio/000004_ref.wav", "original_text": "都动筷子呀，这一会儿菜凉了，辜负姜老板的一番好意嘛啊。"}
{"tag": "zh_000005", "lang": "zh", "split": "split_demo", "original_idx": 5, "original_audio": "/inspire/hdd/project/embodied-multimodality/public/kxhuang/instructtts_data/instruction_12khrs_new_asr_partial_wavs/chinese_drama/zh_short/1/Speechpretrain_Speech-chinese_drama_flac-segment-00-1f72f3242079e369761e75f7ebf7bdca-013.flac", "ref_text": "我单纯觉得那个灯亮好看。", "moss_output": "/inspire/qb-ilm2/project/embodied-multimodality/public/xyzhang/projects/vcdata_construction/outputs/instruction_0.1_enzh/zh/split_demo/ref_audio/000005_ref.wav", "original_text": "双红跟我讲了枯枝的事。"}
